<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">H.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;The
Yum! Brands,&nbsp;Inc. group of companies (the &ldquo;<U>Yum! Group</U>&rdquo;) has decided to undertake an internal reorganization to
separate ownership of the Pizza Hut assets within the Yum! Group (the &ldquo;<U>Corporate Reorganization</U>&rdquo;). As part of said
