amended, solely with respect to the KFC and Taco Bell Brands) to remove all rights and obligations of Licensor and Licensee associated
with the Pizza Hut brand, and following the execution of this Agreement, the Original MLA shall continue to apply as between Licensee
and Cherry Glade Ventures Limited (as assignee of Licensor with respect to the Pizza Hut brand) covering the Pizza Hut brand.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">In consideration of the foregoing
