and the second Benchmark Year is January&nbsp;1, 2017 through December&nbsp;31, 2017 (corresponding to the second Measurement Period of
January&nbsp;1, 2018 through December&nbsp;31, 2022).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

