that is a Competitor or to any group of related persons or entities (as the term group is interpreted for purposes of Section&nbsp;13(d)&nbsp;of
the United States Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended (a &ldquo;<U>Group</U>&rdquo;)) where any member of such Group is a Competitor;</P>

