<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">6.3.2.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;Fulfill
its obligations under each Sublicense and cause each Sublicensee to operate its Restaurants in compliance with the Sublicense, this Agreement,
the Brand Standards and Applicable Laws.</P>

