<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT>6.4&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;</FONT><U>Release
and Covenant Not to Sue</U>. Licensee, for itself and on behalf of all other Licensee Releasing Parties, hereby irrevocably and unconditionally
releases, acquits and forever discharges the Licensor Released Parties, from all actions, causes of action, suits, debts, liens, obligations,
