<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT>8.2&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;</FONT><U>Reports</U>.
In addition to any other reports required under this Agreement, Licensee shall submit to Licensor or its representatives, at Licensee&rsquo;s
