<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">9.1.2.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;If
a Party has any reason to believe that a violation of its confidentiality obligations set forth herein has occurred, that Party shall
promptly notify the other Party and shall cooperate, at its expense, with the other Party in any action or proceeding deemed necessary
