<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(c)&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;If
Licensor exercises the Taco Bell Licensor Purchase Right, Licensor and Licensee will attempt in good faith to agree on the purchase price
(except in the case of paragraph 4(b)(i)&nbsp;above) and terms and procedures for the exercise of Licensor&rsquo;s rights hereunder,
