<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(c)&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;Licensee
shall provide the reports contemplated by this paragraph 4 via a secure file transfer protocol (SFTP) hosted by Licensor or its Affiliate
or pursuant to such other method as mutually agreed.</P>

